cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Lab-Grown Import Monitor"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible monthly series on United States imports of cut
  laboratory-grown diamonds. The primary series uses US Census Bureau HTS
  7104.91.10.00 data and is cross-checked against UN Comtrade HS 710491 data.
  Each dated edition includes source notes, methodology, caveats, tables, and
  charts. Customs value is not represented as retail price or a
  quality-adjusted price index.
type: dataset
